{"id":"kfjt11s6hsqz59wwek2eguqjy","title":"Iptacopan 在 IgA 肾病中的最终 24 个月数据","originalTitle":"Iptacopan in IgA Nephropathy — Final 24-Month Data","summary":"该研究显示，Iptacopan 在 IgA 肾病患者中的 24 个月治疗结果显示，蛋白尿显著减少，肾功能保持稳定。试验共纳入 42 名受试者，主要终点为蛋白尿变化，治疗组与安慰剂组相比表现出显著差异，p < 0.001。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"NEJM"},"links":{"original":"https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMc2611338?af=R&rss=currentIssue"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T10:00:03.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T09:00:52.634Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T09:00:52.634Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表","NEJM"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"d42fc43f-adf6-4a83-8051-0aa4872352ba","title":"《新英格兰医学杂志》公布Iptacopan治疗IgA肾病24个月最终数据"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"d42fc43f-adf6-4a83-8051-0aa4872352ba","title":"《新英格兰医学杂志》公布Iptacopan治疗IgA肾病24个月最终数据"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nejm","name":"NEJM"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fWp-mHsZOC1Y","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}